# Allow-list: only what the Dockerfile builds from is sent to the (remote) builder,
# so local notes, databases and secrets in the checkout can never be uploaded.
*
!Dockerfile
!requirements.lock
!alembic.ini
!services/
!apps/web/

# Local build and test output inside the allowed folders.
apps/web/node_modules
apps/web/dist
apps/web/test-results*
apps/web/smoke-out
apps/web/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
**/.runtime
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.env*
